  "title": "The Future of Outdoor Living: 6 Trends Shaping Backyards This Year",
  "summary": "WINCHESTER, Va. (March 19, 2026) – Outdoor living isn’t just a trend for 2026, it’s a priority. According to the latest Outdoor Living Trend Report from the International Casual Furnishings Association, 77% of U.S. homeowners say they wish they spent more time outside, and nearly 60% plan to invest in their outdoor spaces this year, with durability and practicality topping their wish lists.",
